--- clean_imports_verification
verification_type | applies_to | rule | correct_pattern | incorrect_pattern | priority
OnInit_Implementation | Components | Import only if ngOnInit() exists | implements OnInit { ngOnInit() {} } | import OnInit but no ngOnInit | critical
OnDestroy_Implementation | Components | Import only if ngOnDestroy() exists | implements OnDestroy { ngOnDestroy() {} } | import OnDestroy but no ngOnDestroy | critical
Service_Injection | All | Import only if injected | constructor(private service) | import Service but not used | high
Interface_Implementation | All | Import only if implemented | implements Interface | import Interface not implemented | high
Type_Reference | All | Import only if referenced | type: ServiceType | import Type but not used | high
Unused_Variables | All | Remove unused imports | All imports used | import but never called | high

--- lifecycle_interface_checklist
interface | detection_method | must_have_method | action_if_found | action_if_not_found | example
OnInit | grep ngOnInit | ngOnInit() | Keep OnInit import | Remove OnInit import | ngOnInit() { console.log('init'); }
OnDestroy | grep ngOnDestroy | ngOnDestroy() | Keep OnDestroy import | Remove OnDestroy import | ngOnDestroy() { sub.unsubscribe(); }
AfterViewInit | grep ngAfterViewInit | ngAfterViewInit() | Keep AfterViewInit import | Remove AfterViewInit import | ngAfterViewInit() { this.view.update(); }
OnChanges | grep ngOnChanges | ngOnChanges() | Keep OnChanges import | Remove OnChanges import | ngOnChanges(changes) { process(changes); }
DoCheck | grep ngDoCheck | ngDoCheck() | Keep DoCheck import | Remove DoCheck import | ngDoCheck() { validate(); }

--- service_import_validation
scenario | import_status | usage_status | action | reason | example
Scenario_1 | Imported | Used in constructor | Keep | Legitimately needed | import AuthService
Scenario_2 | Imported | Not used | Remove | Unused dependency | Remove import line
Scenario_3 | Imported | Used in template | Keep | Template binding requires | import in component
Scenario_4 | Imported | Used in method | Keep | Method logic requires | import for dependency
Scenario_5 | Not_imported | Used | Error | Missing import | Add import statement

--- cleanup_process_steps
step | task | what_to_check | tool | action | priority
1 | Scan_Imports | All import statements | grep, tsc | List imports | high
2 | Check_Usage | Each imported symbol | read_file, grep | Verify usage | high
3 | Verify_Lifecycle | Lifecycle interfaces | grep for methods | Match interface to method | high
4 | Identify_Unused | Non-referenced imports | Unused analysis | Mark for removal | critical
5 | Remove_Unused | Delete unused imports | editor, linter | Remove lines | critical
6 | Verify_Clean | Final verification | tsc, eslint | Confirm no unused | high

--- angular_lifecycle_hooks_mapping
hook_name | interface_import | method_signature | timing | use_case | priority
Constructor | N/A | constructor() | Before OnInit | DI injection | high
ngOnInit | OnInit | ngOnInit(): void | After constructor | Component init | critical
ngOnChanges | OnChanges | ngOnChanges(changes: SimpleChanges) | Before ngOnInit | Input changes | high
ngDoCheck | DoCheck | ngDoCheck(): void | After ngOnChanges | Custom checks | low
ngAfterContentInit | AfterContentInit | ngAfterContentInit(): void | After ng-content | Content init | medium
ngAfterContentChecked | AfterContentChecked | ngAfterContentChecked(): void | After content check | Post-content | low
ngAfterViewInit | AfterViewInit | ngAfterViewInit(): void | After view init | DOM ready | high
ngAfterViewChecked | AfterViewChecked | ngAfterViewChecked(): void | After view check | Post-view | low
ngOnDestroy | OnDestroy | ngOnDestroy(): void | Before component destroy | Cleanup (subscriptions) | critical

--- import_cleanup_rules_summary
rule_id | rule_description | applies_to | auto_applicable | verification | consequence
RULE_1 | Remove unused imports | All files | Yes | tsc check | No type errors
RULE_2 | Verify lifecycle implementation | Components | Yes | Method grep | Interface matches method
RULE_3 | Verify service injection | All | Yes | Constructor check | Service is dependency
RULE_4 | Verify interface implementation | All | Yes | Interface check | Class implements interface
RULE_5 | Verify type references | All | Yes | Usage check | Type is referenced in code
